  "contract": "The owner explicitly removed the permanent technical stream. Exactly the six existing locale-owned jobs remain. Each directly owns wording, editing, independent review and its actual local resource integration. Reuse the accepted Russian implementation with explicit locale data. No technical inbox, handoff-ready receipt or seventh worker is required. Preserve every historical output and all interrupted drafts, without inventing their acceptance. Shared code repairs belong to the coordinator once; no six-fold engine research. Mechanical candidate materialization/checks use tools/locale_build.py and the existing family resources use tools/locale_resources.py. No paid phase exists solely for manifests, data wrapping, acknowledgment or unchanged checks. Preserve all real source/editorial/poetry/font/native/runtime gates. No game/GUI/screenshot/installer/publication/deployment/server authority is added."
